---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" seo={{ page_description: "Privacy Policy for Battery Digital Passport Hub." } }>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: August 2024</p>

    <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
    <p>When you use our tools or sign up for our guides, we may ask for your email address. This is captured directly into our database via the forms on this site.</p>

    <h2>2. Use of telemetry</h2>
    <p>We use OpenObserve for site analytics to understand which technical guides are most useful. This data is anonymised by default.</p>

    <h2>3. Contact</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about this policy, please reach out via our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
